					"content": "Sudah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220400503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220400503,
					"content": "Bagus sekali. Bagaimana kata mereka?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220400504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ogura Mio"
				},
				{
					"id": 220400504,
					"content": "Buku... dan set peralatan teh? Menarik.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220400505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ogura Mio"
				},
				{
					"id": 220400505,
					"content": "Tapi bagaimana membuatnya? Aku harus memikirkannya matang-matang...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220400506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ogura Mio"
				},
				{
					"id": 220400506,
					"content": "Informasi ini sangat berguna untukku. Terima kasih banyak, tolong jangan tolak imbalan ini.",
